Error [E0109]: `!` needs Bool (true or false) or a whole number, but this is String (text)
  --> tests/ui/bit_not_wrong_type.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(!label)
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: `!` flips bits: a yes becomes a no, and a whole number gets every bit turned over
 Fix: compare the value to something first, e.g. `!(x > 0)`
